The stated invariant **FULU-SG001-INV-004** ("BlobSchedule entries sorted descending by epoch, return first match where epoch <= current_epoch") is **functionally satisfied** by the ascending-sort + reverse-iteration pattern, but only when the sorting comparator produces correct results. The integer overflow in SA-001 means the invariant can be violated for pathological epoch value combinations.

